@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Navigation entry removals
+
+This fork intentionally hides two entries that do not lead to a supported product flow:
+
+- The Settings sidebar does not show `computerUse` / 「电脑控制」 on any platform. The section id, history preference and old navigation intents are retained for compatibility; any remaining intent resolves to `general`. The underlying Computer Use implementation is not deleted, so the entry can be restored by removing `computerUse` from `HIDDEN_SETTINGS_SECTIONS`.
+- The desktop sidebar footer does not render the phone / Web remote-control trigger. The remote-control dialog, host services and mobile `/remote` flow are unchanged; only this desktop entry is removed.
+
+Verification: `settingsPageConfig.test.ts` checks the section is absent on desktop and Web and that residual `computerUse` navigation falls back to `general`; `workspaceSidebarFooterWebRemoteControlTooltip.test.ts` checks the footer no longer renders a remote-control trigger.
